# Staging area for Mac/Linux installers
#
# After triggering the GitHub Actions Release workflow, download the
# CI-built .dmg / .deb / .rpm / .AppImage files into THIS directory.
# Then run `landing/sync-installers.ps1` — it renames them into
# `assets/downloads/` with the canonical filenames the landing's HTML
# references, and the next `bunx vercel --prod` ships them.
#
# Files here are gitignored (see sibling .gitignore) so the repo stays
# small — the canonical source is the CI release artifact.
